"""Horse identity (docs/HORSE_IDENTITY_AND_PEDIGREE_PLAN.md, phase 1a).

Besides the new fields, three data steps:

* every horse gets its own fixed ID (``uid``);
* a typed age becomes an estimated foaling year, so the age goes up each
  year. "15" on a record made in 2026 becomes "foaled c. 2011". The
  reverse step works the ages out again from the same dates;
* spaces and dashes come out of stored microchip numbers, so the same
  chip typed two ways is found as a duplicate.
"""

import re
import uuid
from datetime import date

import core.models
import django.core.validators
import django.db.models.deletion
import simple_history.models
from django.conf import settings
